                        "target_lang_word": "employer",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "employer",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d4bd9b0-9042-3670-8c40-951cf2da8ddb",
                                        "entry_id": "0d6b5e35-b70e-3140-8fe2-6f52ea5c285d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person, firm or other entity which pays for or hires the services of another person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "175b9cdb-c0f6-430c-b305-f7016459e0b6",
                                                "sense_id": "6d4bd9b0-9042-3670-8c40-951cf2da8ddb",
                                                "text": "The skipper Mr. Cooke had hired at Far Harbor was a God-fearing man with a luke warm interest in his new billet and employer, and had only been prevailed upon to take charge of the yacht after the offer of an emolument equal to half a year's sea pay of an ensign in the navy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f361fde-2360-488f-b96e-800d553acb09",
                                                "sense_id": "6d4bd9b0-9042-3670-8c40-951cf2da8ddb",
                                                "text": "Today, at common law, the employer's duty to his employé is to use ordinary and reasonable care for the safety of his employé while he is performing his work."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "358dbafd-c511-41d9-96fa-2f9176759076",
                                                "sense_id": "6d4bd9b0-9042-3670-8c40-951cf2da8ddb",
                                                "text": "the ideal from the point of view of the employer is to have output without employees, and the ideal from the point of view of the employee is to have income without employment."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7b7207b8-df27-40bd-aebc-f75a0e5ee5e2",
                        "source_entry_id": "e1d15688-9393-35b5-8921-1b22cf2e4fb8",
                        "source_sense_id": "27c7a761-ab47-3c3e-8b13-478f39469772",
                        "source_sense_description": "persoon die of bedrijf dat werk verschaft aan anderen",
                        "target_lang_word": "employeur",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "employeur",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e1f32432-5a28-35e5-9ff4-c5b65db32a55",
                                        "entry_id": "d781056c-ea70-3ccc-b11a-e6af4887b987",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne, entreprise ou autre organisme qui emploie des salariés."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2970f2f7-9e65-4286-a865-4f41b2268b58",
                                                "sense_id": "e1f32432-5a28-35e5-9ff4-c5b65db32a55",
                                                "text": "Le non-paiement des cotisations sociales est constitutif d'infraction pénale dans le chef de l’employeur, ou de ses préposés et mandataires qui ont la responsabilité du paiement des cotisations."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1d57259-4274-40c1-81b3-4a914576e287",
                                                "sense_id": "e1f32432-5a28-35e5-9ff4-c5b65db32a55",
                                                "text": "On voit aussi en quoi la notion centrale de co-investissement, présente chez Gary Becker, peut être reconceptualisée à la lumière de ces développements : pour pouvoir exister, le co-investissement employeur-salarié doit être précédé d’un investissement du seul salarié dans des formations plutôt générales et pré-adaptées aux exigences des employeurs c’est-à-dire permettant d’acquérir ces « qualités sociales », conditions de contrats implicites qui permettront des co-investissements."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
